## Backstory
Raised in the temple forge at Hammerfall, Ilsa learned that an oath, like a weld, holds
only if you heat both sides of it. See [[Ilsa backstory]] for the long version.

## Personality Traits
Quiet until the forge is lit. Speaks in finished sentences or not at all.

## Ideals
**Duty.** A promise spoken aloud is already half a debt.

## Bonds
The temple that raised her, and the apprentice she left behind to finish her work.

## Flaws
Mistakes stubbornness for conviction, and only notices afterwards.

## Appearance
Four foot nine, grey-eyed, with a smith's forearms and a burn scar shaped like a rune
she will not explain.

## Notes
